    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etimiraki ile Amori",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa pee ening Adoni-sedek olaiguanani le Yerusalem eneikuna Yoshua pee eibung Ai, neidaikie ninye katukul, aitaas Ai o laiguanani lenye anaa apa enaitaasa Yeriko o laiguanani lenye, o ina naitobira lelo oomanya Gibeon eseriani o Israel netii atua ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neureishoyu ninye oleng, amu enkanasa kitok apa Gibeon, anaa ake duoo ae anasa e nkitoo, o enkaraki naa eikitok apa alang Ai naa magil iltung'ana lenyena pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina neirriwaki Adoni-sedek olaiguanani le Yerusalem Hoham olkilikuai ilo aiguanani le Hebron, o Piram olaiguanani le Yarmut, o Yafia olaiguanani le lakish, neirriwaki sii Debir olaiguanani le Eglon, ejoki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wootu enatii nanu, entaretuoki nanu, emataar iyiook Gibeon; amu eitobira ninye eseriani o Yoshua o te nebo iltung'ana le Israel.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo aiguanak pokira imiet loo Lamori, o ilo aiguanani le Yerusalem, o ilo aiguanani le Hebron, o ilo aiguanani le Yarmut, o ilo aiguanani le Lakish, o laiguanani le Eglon neiturrur iltimito lenye, nepuo ninche te nebo njorin enye pooki neitayu ninche ilng'oborri aaipirakinore Gibeon, neitayunye ninye olarrabal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirriwaki lelo tung'ana le Gibeon Yoshua olkilikuai too lng'oborri te Gilgal, ejo, “Miyeng'iyeng'ie iyie enkaina te nkaraki isinkan linono; tasieku wou enikitii, pee intajeu iyiook, niretu iyiook, amu ore kulo aiguanak pooki loo Lamori oomanya enkop oo ldoinyo neiturrurrote te nkaraki iyiook.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eilepa apa Yoshua te Gilgal, ninye o ltung'ana pooki lo larrabal te nebo ninye, o ltung'ana pooki magil oodupa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Olaitoriani Yoshua, “Miureyu ninche, amu aishooyie nanu ninche apik atua nkaik inono; meitashe hoo oltung'ani lenye te dukuya intae.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eewuo apa Yoshua enetii ninche aipang'aki te luamata, eewuo apa enkewarie pooki eing'uaa Gilgal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepik ninche Olaitoriani olkirutoto te dukuya Israel, laa ninche ootasesekuana ninche te sesekuanata kitok te Gibeon, nemiraa ninche aaimie enkoitoi nashong'ishong e Bet-horon near ninche metuata o metabaiki Aseka o Makeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore eisikita ninche te dukuya Israel, epuoito ninche aadoyio to loshong'ishong'i le Bet-horon, nenang'u Olaitoriani aitadou isoito sapuki aitung'uaa shumata aitadoiki ninche ebaiki Aseka, neye ninche; ilkumok apa ootuata te nkaraki isoito le nchan aalang iltung'ana ootara Israel to lalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yoshua airorie Olaitoriani te ina olong apa naishooyie Olaitoriani Ilamori aisho iltung'ana le Israel; nejo ninye too nkonyek e Israel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aimeigero ena ti atua embuku e Yashar? Eitasho enkolong te mpolos e shumata, neitu eitasim adoyio te ndama pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitu ae kata etumi enkolong naaijo ena too nkolong'i naatulusoitie o too naatusujutua, eji nening Enkai oltoilo lo ltung'ani; amu etijing'a apa Olaitoriani olarrabal te nkaraki Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yoshua ashukunye o Israel pooki te nebo ninye aapuonu ilng'oborri te Gilgal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neisik apa kulo aiguanak pokira imiet, neisudoo ate ti atua enkapune te Makeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netolikioki apa Yoshua, “Ore lelo aiguanak pokira imiet nenotoki eisudori ti atua enkapune te Makeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Yoshua, “Emperiperaki isoito sapuki enkutuk e ina apune, nipikipiki iltung'ana embata enye pee errip ninche; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake emitonini intae te ine, entusujai ilmang'ati linyi, entadoiki ilo kidong'oe lenye, emincho ninche metijing'a nkanas enye; amu eishorua Olaitoriani Enkai inyi apik atua enkaina inyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eidip Yoshua o ltung'ana le Israel aatasesekuan ninche te sesekuanata kitok, o metaba anaa nejutuni ninche, ore ake ilo pisiai, arashu ore ake ilo pisiai lenye otelekua pee ejing atua nena ang'itie naagol naasheta sunta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neshukunye iltung'ana pooki eserian aapuonu enetii Yoshua too lng'oborri te Makeda; nemetii ninye oltung'ani hoo obo otabolo enkutuk te ntorroni ti alo likae tung'ani ninye obo le Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yoshua ajo, “Entabol enkutuk e nkapune nimpang'unyenye lelo aiguanak pokira imiet te nkapune aayau enatii nanu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiko ninche neijia, neyau lelo aiguanak pokira imiet aaitayu te nkapune aayaki ninye, olaiguanani le Yerusalem, o laiguanani le Hebron, o laiguanani le Yarmit, o laiguanani le Lakish, o laiguanani le Eglon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eipang'unye ninche lelo aiguanak aayau enetii Yoshua, neipotu Yoshua iltung'ana pooki le Israel, nejoki lelo kituaak apa loo ltung'ana le njore ooshomo te nebo ninye, “Wootu entinyiku, entipik nkejek inyi enchumata oo murto e kulo aiguanak.” Nepuonu ninche aanyiku nepik nkejek enye nchumat oomurto e lelo aiguanak aaroro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Yoshua ninche, “Emiureishoyu niming'aing'ayiayia; entagoluoto nipijuju; amu nji eiko Olaitoriani ilmang'ati linyi pooki laa ninche iararere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi near Yoshua ninche metuata, neilili ninche too lkeek imiet. Neililio ninche te lelo keek o metaa teipa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kake ore te ndoyioroto e nkolong, neitanapisho Yoshua, neitayuni ninche aaitadou too lkeek, nenang'akini ninche atua ina apune apa naisudorie ate, nepik isoito sapuki enkutuk e ina apune, leton etii o metabaiki ena olong.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eibung'a Yoshua kulie wuejitin e nkop e Amori",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neya apa Yoshua Makeda ina olong, near ninye olaiguanani lenye te nepi o lalem; neidaikie ninye tukul pooki tung'ani otii atua, eitu ninye eleku oltung'ani; neitaas ilo aiguanani le Makeda anaa apa enaitaasa olaiguanani le Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yoshua alo agiroo Makeda, o Israel pooki te nebo ninye, nelo Libna, nearare Libna; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitoki sii Olaitoriani aishooyo ninye o laiguanani lenye apik atua enkaina e Israel; near Yoshua ninye te nepi o lalem, o pooki tung'ani otii atua ninye; eitu ninye eleku oltung'ani obo ti atua ninye eishu; neitaas olaiguanani lenye anaa apa enaitaasa olaiguanani le Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo Yoshua agiroo Libna, o Israel pooki te nebo ninye, nelo Lakish, nemuat aaman ninye, neibung ninye: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neishooyo Olaitoriani Lakish apik atua enkaina e Israel, neya ninye te nkolong e are, near ninye te nepi o lalem, o pooki tung'ani otii atua ninye, anaa apa enaitaasa ninye Libna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Horam olaiguanani le Geser alotu aretu Lakish; near Yoshua ninye o ltung'ana lenyena, o metaba anaa neing'uaa ninye meishu hoo oltung'ani obo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yoshua te nebo Israel pooki aagiroo Lakish nepuo Eglon; neng'adu ninche ninye, neibung ninye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neya ninche ninye ina olong, near ninye te nepi o lalem; ore pooki tung'ani otii atua ninye neidaikie tukul ina olong, anaa apa enaitaasa Lakish.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yoshua te nebo Israel pooki aagiroo Eglon nepuo Hebron; neibung ninche ninye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neya ninye, near ninye te nepi o lalem, olaiguanani lenye o nkang'itie enyena, o pooki tung'ani otii atua; eitu ninye eleku oltung'ani hoo obo oishu anaa apa enaitaasa Eglon, neidaikie ninye tukul te nebo pooki tung'ani otii atua ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yoshua, te nebo Israel pooki, aashukunye aapuonu Debir neibung ninye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neya ninye te nebo olaiguanani lenye o nkang'itie enyena pooki; near ninche te nepi o lalem, neidaikie tukul pooki tung'ani otii atua ninye, eitu ninye eleku oltung'ani obo eishu; ore anaa apa enataasa te Hebron o te Libna o laiguanani lenye neijia sii eikuna Debir o laiguanani lenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eisula apa Yoshua enkop pooki, ina kop oo ldoinyo e Negeb, o ina kop nagum o neeshong'ishong, o laiguanak lenye pooki; eitu ninye eleku hoo oltung'ani oishu, kake eidaikie tukul pooki ng'ae oishu, anaa apa enaitanapishe Olaitoriani Enkai e Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nemir apa Yoshua ninche ebaiki Kadesh-Barnea o metabaiki Gasa, o enkop pooki e Goshen ebaiki Gibeon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neya apa Yoshua kulo aiguanak pooki o nkuapi enye te nkata nabo, amu etijing'a Olaitoriani Enkai e Israel olarrabal te nkaraki Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neshukunye taa Yoshua, o Israel pooki te nebo ninye, aapuonu ilng'oborri te Gilgal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
